{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/f3a6dc4c8c524f24cb3293aa24b330b7.avif?t=1767174104\" width=1232 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Meow Palace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy, laid-back game that blends idle play, bonding, and cultural discovery. Slip into the paws of a stray kitty who\u2019s wandered into the Forbidden City. With the help of palace cats, you\u2019ll learn new tricks, collect treasures, unlock stories, and experience the whimsical life of a royal feline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/1b9ca03eaf7fa68d5ada4119c08b6ac0.avif?t=1767174104\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/9e25b5e4353525da57512f7e679b4ec2.avif?t=1767174104\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The story begins with a stray cat that accidentally wanders into the palace\u2014but its destiny is up to you.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create A Cat</strong>: Customize everything from name, fur pattern, pupils, ear shapes, and tails to craft your perfect palace companion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/368839d5f5681c326b982a1ec09b94ab.poster.avif?t=1767174104\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/368839d5f5681c326b982a1ec09b94ab.webm?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/368839d5f5681c326b982a1ec09b94ab.mp4?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/d17f3620ee467d0f8e8eca243e121159.avif?t=1767174104\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go from \u201cStray Cat\u201d\u00a0to \u201cImperial Guardian\u201d\u00a0through effortless idle gameplay.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Training</strong>: Learn up to 15 skills, including Imperial Cuisine, Traditional Chinese Medicine, Peking Opera, and Fishing with the instruction\u00a0of veteran palace cats. Higher skills = better yields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/d335cfb5cce520572581fc223ae779e3.poster.avif?t=1767174104\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/d335cfb5cce520572581fc223ae779e3.webm?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/d335cfb5cce520572581fc223ae779e3.mp4?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Fashion &amp; Furniture</strong>: Use collected materials and blueprints to make outfits and home d\u00e9cor\u00a0for your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palace Encyclopedia</strong>: Every crafted item, animal encounter, and discovered treasure is collected into your growing compendium.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/62f411bb1231eeaaf305219b19ae74c1.avif?t=1767174104\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/06699426da4a16377a0c992daa969e6c.avif?t=1767174104\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feeling stressed at work? Tired of studying? Let your palace cat stay on your desktop.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Pet Mode</strong>: Your cat lives directly on your Windows desktop, quietly gathering resources while you\u2019re busy. Tap it when you take a break and enjoy simple, soothing interactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/13e0d4f9f83574c850712c57c4169cb5.poster.avif?t=1767174104\" width=402 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/13e0d4f9f83574c850712c57c4169cb5.webm?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/13e0d4f9f83574c850712c57c4169cb5.mp4?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/82b31ebabbe290199c76ed72d0fcc66d.avif?t=1767174104\" width=780 height=130 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter NPC cats based on actual residents of the Forbidden City, and explore the Palace Museum through their eyes.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Palace Cat Family</strong>: Meet Aobai the dignified, Sheriff the clever, and Mantou the gentle\u2014each being the inspiration of NPC cats in the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/cdbc064763c07c3f134933bfbfa5855d.avif?t=1767174104\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Seasons of the Forbidden City</strong>: Unlock classic locations, such as Hall of Supreme Harmony, Palace of Heavenly Purity, Palace of Compassion and Tranquility, and more. Game time syncs with real time, letting your cat walk you through spring blossoms, summer rains, autumn leaves, and winter snow in the Forbidden City.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/6e1f05c19946b882c56fac92ca302ec5.poster.avif?t=1767174104\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/6e1f05c19946b882c56fac92ca302ec5.webm?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915610/extras/6e1f05c19946b882c56fac92ca302ec5.mp4?t=1767174104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Entry into the Palace Gates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3915610/45c18e02d71fbea603686ab71719fa6315cb376d.jpg"},{"name":"A Specialized Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3915610/89f56c6c3540e519920dede6c64ff7570ad2d7b4.jpg"},{"name":"Many Skills Are Never a Burden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3915610/e3bdb1c659cd8f68674813dc8ebb5833